# Examples that deliberately have no gallery figure, one
# "script.py: reason" per line. A reason is mandatory, and an entry naming
# no script, or a script that IS in GALLERY_SCRIPTS, fails
# scripts/check_user_docs.py. Every other example is a gallery script.
#
# This is a decision, not a debt: it may grow when a new example has
# nothing worth plotting. Undecided examples sit in docs/.user-docs-exempt.
coarse_doppler_bank_demo.py: prints the bank geometry and one detection; the bank's figures are on the burst-bank design page
